        // With fee: balanceAfter = balanceBefore - (potBefore + 10) (since fee 1 goes to bank externally and winner gets potBefore+9). Wait: 
        // balanceAfter = balanceBefore + 10 (from msg.value) - fee (1) - (potBefore+10 - fee) = balanceBefore - potBefore.
        // Without fee: balanceAfter = balanceBefore + 10 - (potBefore+10 - 1) = balanceBefore - potBefore + 1.
        // So if fee is paid, balanceAfter = balanceBefore - potBefore; if not, balanceAfter = balanceBefore - potBefore + 1.
