        // With fee: transfer 1 to bank, then transfer pot-FEE=9 to winner. balanceAfter = balanceBefore + 10 - 1 - 9 = balanceBefore. So equals!
        // Without fee: transfer 9 to winner. balanceAfter = balanceBefore + 10 - 9 = balanceBefore + 1. So balance increases!
        // Therefore if potBefore=0, a winning play with fee does NOT decrease contract balance, while without fee it INCREASES.
        // So rule: contract balance must NOT increase after a winning play. 
